---
interface Props {language?:"en"|"zh-CN"}
const {language="en"}=Astro.props;
const tr=(en:string,zh:string)=>language==="zh-CN"?zh:en;
---
<section class="stage-practice wrap" aria-labelledby="stage-title">
  <div class="stage-heading"><p class="eyebrow">{tr("Imagine the room","想象一下表达的空间")}</p><h2 id="stage-title">{tr("Before the first word.","在第一句话之前。")}</h2><p>{tr("Use this imagined room to rehearse an opening. You can practise seated or standing, in a space that works for you.","用这个想象中的空间练习开场。你可以坐着或站着，在适合自己的空间里练习。")}</p></div>
  <div class="stage-grid">
    <figure><img src="/media/rehearsal-stage.webp" width="960" height="720" loading="lazy" alt={tr("Fictional miniature stage with a gold speaking mark, a lectern on the left and six chairs facing the stage.","虚构的舞台微缩场景：金色圆点标出表达位置，左侧有讲台，六把椅子面向舞台。")} /><figcaption>{tr("Original 3D illustration of an imagined room. It does not depict a SpeakKai venue or a real event.","原创三维概念插图，展示想象中的空间，并非 SpeakKai 的实际场地或真实活动。")}</figcaption></figure>
    <div class="stage-cues">
      <details open><summary>{tr("01 / Choose your position","01 / 选择位置")}</summary><p>{tr("Imagine speaking from the gold mark. Choose a comfortable position where a listener can see or hear you. Adapt the position to your access needs.","想象自己从金色圆点的位置开始表达。选择一个舒适、方便倾听者看见或听见你的位置，并根据自己的身体与行动需要调整。")}</p></details>
      <details><summary>{tr("02 / Give the listener your attention","02 / 把注意力给倾听者")}</summary><p>{tr("Choose one chair as your listener. Say a short opening sentence toward that person. Comfortable orientation matters more than holding eye contact.","把其中一把椅子想象成倾听者。朝向对方说一句简短的开场白。找到舒适的朝向，比一直保持眼神接触更重要。")}</p></details>
      <details><summary>{tr("03 / Pause, listen, try once more","03 / 停一下，听一听，再试一次")}</summary><p>{tr("Pause before your first word. Ask a practice partner which words were easiest to hear. Choose one small adjustment, then repeat the opening once.","开口前先停一拍。问练习伙伴：哪些词最容易听清？选择一处小调整，再说一次开场白。")}</p></details>
      <p class="stage-note">{tr("The gold mark is a visual prompt. A real room needs its own sound and access checks.","金色圆点只是视觉提示。实际场地的声音与通行条件，需要另外确认。")}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
 .stage-practice{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-block:45px 64px}.stage-heading{max-width:720px}.stage-heading .eyebrow{color:var(--blue)}h2{font-size:clamp(32px,3.5vw,48px);margin-top:16px}.stage-heading>p:last-child{color:var(--muted);margin-top:20px;font-size:18px}.stage-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:40px;margin-top:30px;align-items:start}img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px}figcaption,.stage-note{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:16px;line-height:1.7}details{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-block:20px}summary{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;line-height:1.5}details p{margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:760px){.stage-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}}@media print{details::details-content{content-visibility:visible}details p{display:block}.stage-grid{display:block}}
</style>
